{"seq":2,"slug":"hashing-foundations","title":"哈希基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/probabilistic-data-structures/foundations/hashing-foundations","wordCount":1765,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"哈希基础\">哈希基础</h1><p>把布隆过滤器、HyperLogLog、Count-Min Sketch 拆到最底层，你会发现它们都靠同一个零件运转：一个把任意输入打散成均匀随机数的哈希函数。这些结构的全部数学保证——误判率、估计误差、置信区间——都建立在一个假设之上：哈希输出像真随机数一样均匀且独立。哈希选得好，理论误差就成立；选得差，整套公式立刻失效，误差可能成倍放大。所以在碰任何具体结构之前，必须先把哈希这块地基弄清楚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>哈希函数是所有概率数据结构的共同发动机：它把任意输入打散成看似均匀随机的数，结构再从这些随机数里榨取统计信息。但「能用的哈希」和「好的哈希」差别巨大——普通哈希表对哈希很宽容，概率结构却把全部精度保证都押在哈希的统计性质上。这一篇围绕三件事展开：概率结构对哈希到底有哪些硬要求、该选哪一类哈希、以及如何用少量哈希拼出结构所需的多个哈希。</p>\n<h2 id=\"概率结构对哈希的三个要求\">概率结构对哈希的三个要求</h2><p>普通哈希表对哈希函数的要求很宽松——分布大致均匀、计算够快就行，碰撞了拉链或开放寻址兜底。概率数据结构对哈希的要求严苛得多，因为哈希的统计性质直接决定了结构的精度保证。具体有三个核心要求：</p>\n<p>第一是<strong>均匀性</strong>：哈希值应在输出空间内均匀分布，任何一个桶被命中的概率都接近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span>。均匀性差会让某些位置过载，碰撞集中，误差偏离理论值。</p>\n<p>第二是<strong>独立性</strong>：不同元素的哈希值应互不相关，理想情况是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个哈希函数两两独立。布隆过滤器的误判率公式、Count-Min 的误差边界都假设哈希之间相互独立——这一假设若不成立，估计的方差会显著变大。</p>\n<p>第三是<strong>雪崩效应</strong>：输入哪怕只改一个比特，输出也应有约一半比特发生翻转。雪崩差的哈希会让相似输入（如 <code>user_1</code>、<code>user_2</code>）落到相邻甚至相同的桶，破坏均匀性。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>性质</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>不满足的后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>均匀性</td>\n<td>每个桶命中概率约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>某些桶过载，碰撞集中，误差超标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>独立性</td>\n<td>多个哈希值互不相关</td>\n<td>估计方差变大，置信区间失真</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>雪崩效应</td>\n<td>改一比特输入翻转约半输出</td>\n<td>相似输入聚簇，破坏均匀性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>速度</td>\n<td>每秒上亿次调用</td>\n<td>成为流式处理的瓶颈</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"加密哈希还是非加密哈希\">加密哈希还是非加密哈希</h2><p>很多人第一反应是用 SHA-256 这种加密哈希——它们的均匀性和雪崩效应确实极好。但概率数据结构几乎从不用加密哈希，原因只有一个字：慢。SHA-256 为抵抗密码学攻击设计了大量轮运算，单次计算的开销在流式场景下完全无法接受。</p>\n<p>概率结构需要的不是「抗碰撞攻击」，而是「在非对抗环境下分布均匀且极快」。这正是<strong>非加密哈希</strong>的定位。工程上最常用的几个：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>MurmurHash3</strong>：分布质量好、速度快，是布隆过滤器、HyperLogLog 的经典默认选择，许多库（包括早期 Guava）都用它。</li>\n<li><strong>xxHash / xxh3</strong>：以极致速度著称，xxh3 在现代 CPU 上吞吐可达每秒数十 GB，是 RocksDB、Zstandard 等系统的常用选择。</li>\n<li><strong>FarmHash / CityHash</strong>：Google 出品，针对短字符串和现代 CPU 优化。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>需要警惕的一点是<strong>对抗场景</strong>：如果攻击者能构造大量哈希碰撞的输入（哈希洪水攻击），非加密哈希的均匀性假设会被恶意打破。此时应改用带密钥的哈希如 <strong>SipHash</strong>——它在保持较快速度的同时抵抗碰撞构造，许多语言的内置哈希表默认用它防 DoS。这个权衡在<a href=\"../practice/pitfalls-tuning\">陷阱与调参</a>里会作为一类典型坑再次出现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"双重哈希-用两个模拟出-k-个\">双重哈希：用两个模拟出 k 个</h2><p>布隆过滤器需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个独立哈希函数，HyperLogLog 也常需要从哈希值切出多段。如果真去实现 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个独立的哈希函数，既费代码又费 CPU。工程上普遍采用 Kirsch 与 Mitzenmacher 提出的**双重哈希（double hashing）**技巧：只算两个独立哈希 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_1(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_2(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个哈希用线性组合生成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace></mspace><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mspace width=\"0.3333em\"/><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_i(x) = h_1(x) + i \\cdot h_2(x) \\pmod{m}, \\quad i = 0, 1, \\dots, k-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace allowbreak\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.3333em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>他们证明了：只要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 本身足够好，这样组合出的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个哈希在渐近意义上不会让布隆过滤器的误判率变差。实践中更省的做法是算一个 64 位哈希，把高 32 位当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、低 32 位当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，于是连第二次哈希计算都省了。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  X[输入元素 x] --&gt; H[一次 64 位哈希]&#10;  H --&gt; H1[高 32 位 = h1]&#10;  H --&gt; H2[低 32 位 = h2]&#10;  H1 --&gt; C0[&quot;g0 = h1 mod m&quot;]&#10;  H1 --&gt; C1[&quot;g1 = h1 + 1·h2 mod m&quot;]&#10;  H1 --&gt; C2[&quot;g2 = h1 + 2·h2 mod m&quot;]&#10;  H2 --&gt; C1&#10;  H2 --&gt; C2&#10;  C0 --&gt; BITS[映射到位数组位置]&#10;  C1 --&gt; BITS&#10;  C2 --&gt; BITS\">flowchart TD\n  X[输入元素 x] --&gt; H[一次 64 位哈希]\n  H --&gt; H1[高 32 位 = h1]\n  H --&gt; H2[低 32 位 = h2]\n  H1 --&gt; C0[\"g0 = h1 mod m\"]\n  H1 --&gt; C1[\"g1 = h1 + 1·h2 mod m\"]\n  H1 --&gt; C2[\"g2 = h1 + 2·h2 mod m\"]\n  H2 --&gt; C1\n  H2 --&gt; C2\n  C0 --&gt; BITS[映射到位数组位置]\n  C1 --&gt; BITS\n  C2 --&gt; BITS</pre><p>这个技巧让「需要很多哈希」的结构在工程上变得廉价，是<a href=\"../membership/bloom-filters\">布隆过滤器</a>、<a href=\"../cardinality-frequency/count-min-sketch\">Count-Min Sketch</a> 等结构实现里几乎标配的优化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"哈希的截取与位运算\">哈希的截取与位运算</h2><p>概率结构常常不需要整个哈希值，而是从它的不同部分切出所需信息。这种「切割哈希」的手法在多个结构里反复出现，值得单独点明。</p>\n<p><a href=\"../cardinality-frequency/hyperloglog\">HyperLogLog</a> 把哈希值切成两段：前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 位决定元素落入哪个寄存器（桶），剩余位用来数前导零的长度。<a href=\"../membership/quotient-filters\">商过滤器</a>把哈希值拆成「商」与「余数」，商决定存储槽位、余数当作指纹存进去。布隆的双重哈希也是对一个哈希值取高低位。</p>\n<p>这些手法共享一个前提：哈希输出的每一个比特都应当是均匀且独立的，于是任意截取的子段仍然均匀。这正是为什么前面强调雪崩效应——只有每个比特都「充分混合」，按位切割才安全。如果哈希的高位混合得好、低位有规律（某些弱哈希就这样），按位切割会引入隐蔽的偏差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>概率数据结构的所有精度保证都建立在「哈希输出均匀且独立」的假设上，哈希选错则公式失效、误差放大。</li>\n<li>三个核心要求是均匀性、独立性、雪崩效应，外加流式场景必需的速度。</li>\n<li>用非加密哈希（MurmurHash3、xxHash、FarmHash）而非加密哈希，因为需要的是快与均匀而非抗攻击；对抗场景改用带密钥的 SipHash。</li>\n<li>双重哈希用两个哈希线性组合模拟出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个，常以「一个 64 位哈希切高低 32 位」实现，是布隆、CMS 的标配优化。</li>\n<li>多种结构通过截取哈希的不同位段获取所需信息，这依赖每个比特都充分混合——又一次落回雪崩效应。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"哈希基础","id":"哈希基础"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"概率结构对哈希的三个要求","id":"概率结构对哈希的三个要求"},{"level":2,"text":"加密哈希还是非加密哈希","id":"加密哈希还是非加密哈希"},{"level":2,"text":"双重哈希：用两个模拟出 k 个","id":"双重哈希-用两个模拟出-k-个"},{"level":2,"text":"哈希的截取与位运算","id":"哈希的截取与位运算"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"为什么用概率数据结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/probabilistic-data-structures/foundations/why-probabilistic"},"next":{"title":"空间与精度权衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/probabilistic-data-structures/foundations/space-accuracy-tradeoff"}}